{title: All Praise and Glory To You Lord}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{key: C}
{tempo: 129}

>Lyrics

(Very long introduction)

I lift my voice to heav'n and praise you Lord

I turn my heart to you and live by your Word

I yield my will to yours and grow in your grace

I long to know you more and see your face

May all I think and say and do bring honor

praise and glory to you Lord!

I give my hands to serve in Jesus' name

I give my voice, your Gospel to proclaim

I give my life to serve and make you known

All praise and glory to you Lord

All praise and glory to you Lord!
